                "text": "The Casper Snug™ is CertiPUR-US Certified, meaning it is made without ozone depleting chemicals and regulated by the Consumer Product Safety Commission Low VOC (Volatile Organic Compound) emissions for indoor air quality (less than 0.5 parts per million).The Casper Snug is a medium-firm foam mattress composed of three layers that work together to help kids sleep comfortably through the night. As kids grow over time, you can count on the durable Casper Core to remain supportive, while Breathe Flex Foam and Soothe Memory Foam provide consistent airflow and pressure relief. "
