                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "When selecting a pillow for a child, we recommend low loft, allergen-free material that’s firm enough for your child’s head to rest comfortably. It is crucial that they have enough support to maintain good sleep posture through the night.The Original Pillow is our dreamy down-alternative pillow, filled with tiny silky fibers that balance softness and support. Our unique pillow-in-pillow design allows you to adjust the loft to your child’s preference. The Nap Pillow is the perfect mini pillow for tiny sleepers and travelers alike. Enjoy the comfort and support of our original pillow on the go. With the same silky down-alternative fibers, you can fluff as needed and store in a convenient travel pouch.Both pillows are also machine washable, helping protect against mold, dust mites, and bacteria."
