          "description": "The Everywhere Bag is our standard-sized version of our best-selling silhouette, with a full wraparound zip opening to give easy access to the spacious main compartment. Its trolley sleeve perfectly secures to any Away suitcase, but fits best on our carry-on bags. It also features a detachable padded shoulder strap with concealable D rings, and top handles sized for carrying it on your shoulder comfortably. With a padded 16\u0026quot; laptop pocket and a detachable key clip, we also love it as a daily work bag or gym bag.",
